+/*----------------------------------------------------------
+OpenKey - The Cross platform Open source Vietnamese Keyboard application.
+
+Copyright (C) 2019 Mai Vu Tuyen
+Contact: maivutuyen.91@gmail.com
+Github: https://github.com/tuyenvm/OpenKey
